  "notes": "USAGE:\nDo not confuse {要約|ようやく} (summary) with the adverb ⟦{漸|ようや}く→漸く：00429_youyaku⟧ (finally, at last), which is a homophone with a completely different meaning and kanji. {要約|ようやく} can be used as a noun or as a ⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ verb meaning \"to summarize.\"\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {要約|ようやく}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to summarize\n- {要約|ようやく}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{書|か}く→書く：00477_kaku⟧: to write a summary\n- {要約|ようやく}⟦{文|ぶん}→文：03716_bun⟧: summary text\n- {要約|ようやく}{力|りょく}: summarization ability\n- {三行|さんぎょう}{要約|ようやく}: three-line summary (internet slang for TL;DR)",
